diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 0cd6db5..0af6328 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,4 +1,13 @@
-An HTTP server that routes each request by the method and target in its request line.
+A TCP-based HTTP server that parses request lines, headers, and Content-Length bodies before routing. Malformed or truncated requests receive `400 Bad Request`.
+
+Routes:
+- `GET /`: empty success response
+- `GET /users/:userId/posts/:postId`: replies with `<userId> <postId>`
+- Any method on `/echo`: replies with `<method> <path>` as plain text
+
+Transfer-Encoding is not supported. Connections close after one response.
+
+Tests: `npm test`
 
 Run: `node server.js`
 
